# Breakwater Customs (CIPlay breakwater_customs): the customs house, the entry rules, the radio desk and the watch
# tower's locker (receiver, antenna), the permit desk refusing until the cargo is weighed, the smuggler's tip.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Breakwater Customs
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rumour Is True
zone customs_house
expect step 1
read Authority entry rules
expect step 2
open Radio desk
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect step 3
open Watch tower locker
wait 3
expect step 4
use permitstamp
expect story permit 0
use weighscale
expect story weighed 1
use permitstamp
expect story permit 1
expect step 5
zone signal_hill
expect step 6
read Keeper's log
expect step 7
zone wreckers_cave
expect step 8
open Seized boat's hold
wait 3
expect step 9
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the boom signal box
expect hidden bw_rewchest
use bw_machine
expect hidden bw_rewchest
read Boom keeper's notice
expect step 10
zone bw_trail
expect step 11
openat 76.53 -2.71
zone bw_summit
expect step 12
expect stand 59.76 -3.76 h=32
open Old customs light deck box
wait 3
expect story bw_top 1
expect step 13
zone bw_deep
expect step 14
expect stand 37 -78 h=-12
open Drowned bonded store strongbox
wait 3
expect story bw_deep 1
expect step 15
use bw_machine
expect shown bw_rewchest
expect story bw_fixed 1
open Boom signal box reward
wait 3
read Channel light log
expect step 16
read Smuggler's tip
expect done
